cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Analysis code for: Gut microbial gene abundance poorly predicts patient-specific protein output during checkpoint immunotherapy"
abstract: >-
  Analysis, figure and supplementary-analysis code for a two-centre study of
  gut metagenomes and metaproteomes from melanoma patients treated with
  anti-PD-1 and anti-CTLA-4 immune checkpoint blockade.
type: software
license: MIT
